      <description>An Android application for tracking and reconciling financial transactions using notification capture and local processing.</description>
      <content:encoded>&lt;div class=&#34;project-meta&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;dl&gt;&#xA;&lt;dt&gt;Problem&lt;/dt&gt;&#xA;&lt;dd&gt;Track and reconcile financial transactions on Android using notification signals and local processing — without exposing private financial data.&lt;/dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;dt&gt;Stack&lt;/dt&gt;&#xA;&lt;dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul class=&#34;tech-list&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Kotlin&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Jetpack Compose&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Room&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;WorkManager&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Koin&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Local ML / embeddings&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;/dl&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Plutus is an Android application for tracking and reconciling financial transactions. It focuses on &lt;strong&gt;transaction parsing&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;local processing&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;automation&lt;/strong&gt; rather than a cloud-hosted finance product.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The design center is on-device: notifications and local storage drive the workflow so sensitive financial detail stays under the user&amp;rsquo;s control.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;problem&#34;&gt;Problem&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Transaction records often arrive as noisy notification text. Turning that into structured history requires:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;reliable parsing of heterogeneous message formats&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;durable local storage and reconciliation&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;background work that stays correct when the app is not open&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;categorization that does not depend on shipping raw statements to a server&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;architecture&#34;&gt;Architecture&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;goat svg-container &#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;svg&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;font-family=&#34;Menlo,Lucida Console,monospace&#34;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;viewBox=&#34;0 0 296 313&#34;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;g transform=&#39;translate(8,16)&#39;&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 0,0 L 224,0&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 0,32 L 112,32&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 112,32 L 224,32&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 0,80 L 224,80&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 0,112 L 112,112&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 112,112 L 224,112&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 0,160 L 224,160&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 0,192 L 56,192&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 56,192 L 168,192&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 168,192 L 224,192&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 0,240 L 104,240&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 128,240 L 280,240&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 0,288 L 104,288&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 128,288 L 280,288&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 0,0 L 0,32&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 0,80 L 0,112&#39; fill=&#39;none&#39; stroke=&#39;currentColor&#39;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;&lt;path d=&#39;M 0,160 L 0,192&#39; fill=&#39;no